OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fand hill snow will spread eastwards
OL,7,Fthrough the evening and overnight,
OL,8,Fpossibly becoming dry over western
OL,9,FArgyll by morning. Breezy with coastal
OL,10,Fgales at first, winds easing later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRain will clear to the east
OL,13,Fthrough the morning, briefly heavy
OL,14,Fbefore it does so. Becoming drier by
OL,15,Fthe afternoon with sunny spells and
OL,16,Fscattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
