OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers possible on
OL,7,FSaturday. Heavy showers spreading east
OL,8,FSunday. Milder with further rain and
OL,9,Fstrong winds arriving from the west on
OL,10,FMonday.
